<p><span id="u-credit-00164" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00164" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00164-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6401769&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608952355" alt="Freezingheart" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6401769)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;">Freezingheart</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588840447 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 May 2020 08:34</span></p>
</div>
